# tof_silent_takeoff_bias_est_high.expect — ToF silent early in the auto-takeoff climb, estimate 28 % high AND accelerometer offset error +0.2 m/s^2
# 自動離陸の上昇の初期に ToF が出力停止、見積もり 28 % 高く、加速度計のオフセット誤差 +0.2 m/s^2
exit 0
log_contains any "Transition: ARMED_GROUND → TAKEOFF"
log_contains any "Downward ToF silent (>= 300 ms without a sample) in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING"
log_contains any "Blind landing: ToF silent, velocity loop"
log_contains any "Touchdown while the ToF is silent (impact) → landing complete, not an emergency"
log_contains any "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
log_contains any "ARM rejected: downward ToF is silent"
log_absent any "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING"
log_absent any "touchdown by time"
log_absent any "emergency DISARM"
order "in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING" "Blind landing: ToF silent"
order "Blind landing: ToF silent" "Touchdown while the ToF is silent (impact)"
order "Touchdown while the ToF is silent (impact)" "ARM rejected: downward ToF is silent"
metric alt_max < 1.2 in 7.5 20.0
metric descent_speed_max < 1.2 in 8.4 15.0
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 14.0 20.0
